---
source: crates/skif-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: human.stdout
---
RULE                            CATEGORY   DEFAULT  FIXABLE    SUMMARY
empty-dependencies              manifest   error    safe       A dependency section (`dependencies`, `devDependencies`, `peerDependencies`, `optionalDependencies`) is an empty object.
root-package-private-field      manifest   error    safe       The root `package.json` must set `"private": true` so it cannot be published by accident.
root-package-manager-field      manifest   error    none       The root `package.json` must declare the package manager in `packageManager` or `devEngines.packageManager`.
root-package-dependencies       manifest   warning  unsafe     The root package should only have `devDependencies`; runtime dependencies belong to the packages that use them.
types-in-dependencies           manifest   error    safe       A private package lists `@types/*` packages in `dependencies`; type packages belong in `devDependencies`.
member-toolchain-fields         manifest   warning  unsafe     Member packages should not declare `packageManager` or `engines`; the root package owns the toolchain.
incompatible-peer-dependencies  manifest   warning  none       The version a package installs in `devDependencies` does not satisfy the range it declares in `peerDependencies`.
unsorted-dependencies           manifest   error    safe       The entries of a dependency section are not in alphabetical (byte) order.
unmatched-workspace-patterns    workspace  warning  safe       A workspace pattern does not match any directory.
missing-package-manifest        workspace  warning  unsafe     A directory matched by the workspace patterns has no `package.json`.
local-path-dependency           manifest   error    sometimes  A dependency points at a path on disk (`link:`, `file:`, `portal:` or a relative path) instead of a registry or workspace version.
